          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The words of the wise are as goads; and as nails well fastened are ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the masters of assemblies, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " are given from one shepherd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And furthermore, my son, be admonished: of making many books there is no end; and much study is a weariness of the flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
